The frozen core and quadrature implementation originate from the X6 CST-DUST
parity mixing and mixing qualification packages; see provenance.json.
This extension adds complete finite blocks, weighted Gram normalization,
certified singular values, exact rank factorization and independent controls.
All results concern a declared finite control model, not physical CST evolution.
